  "details": "1. an avatar search. we have been requesting this for so long, and now that mods are gone we can’t use it. \n2. a text to speech option, so mute players can easily communicate without having to struggle with people not being able to read their handwriting.\n3. auto captions, for deaf or HOH people like myself. it would be nice if we could turn these captions on and off for certain players.\n4. more anti crash features.\n5. possibly something like the camera animations mod. to make content creation a little easier.\n6. SMOOTHER TRACKING!!! i know you implemented IK tweaks, but it doesn’t do as good of a job as it should. so possibly update it??\ni understand why you passed EAC so at least pass these features. the top priority ones are 1, 2, and 3.",
